# Build context hygiene: the Dockerfile only COPYs src/, docs/, CLAUDE.md, README.md.
# Everything else is noise at best and credentials at worst (.env holds the
# local operator config, test/local holds real database passwords).
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
dist
test
charts
*.log
*.tgz
src/restore
src/**/*_test.go
